{"id": "22-3887-2-2", "zh": "ā 尾词根的变化形式", "confidence": 85}
{"id": "22-3888-2-10", "zh": "从这里开始，元音结尾的词根按元音的次序讲述，辅音结尾的词根按字母的次序讲述。", "confidence": 85}
{"id": "22-3889-2-7", "zh": "在《迦旃延文法》中称为多音节词根的，在这里称为辅音结尾词根。", "confidence": 75}
{"id": "22-3889-8-13", "zh": "所以在这里没有删除词根末尾元音这项操作。", "confidence": 80}
{"id": "22-3890-2-53", "zh": "khā、khyā：讲说；gā：发声；ghā：嗅取气味；ñā：显现、了知；ṭhā：停止行进；tā：保护；thā：站立；dā：给予；dhā：持守；pā：饮；phā：增长；bhā：发光；mā：度量；yā：行走；lā：拿取、切割；vā：行走、系缚、嗅；sā：品尝、使变薄、终结；hā：舍弃；nhā：洁净。", "confidence": 75}
{"id": "22-3891-2-14", "zh": "加上 tyādi 词尾，在主动语态中加 la 词缀；依大规则，后面接元音时，在 ā 尾词根之后有时加 y 增音。例如 akkhāti。", "confidence": 60}
{"id": "22-3891-15-59", "zh": "删除后面的元音：akkhāyati；kriyaṃ ākhyāti（讲说动作）；ākhyāyati；“被问到时，请说出你的出身”（jātiṃ akkhāhi pucchito）〔经集 423〕；saṅgāyati；“大仙们结集了”（saṅgāyiṃsu mahesayo）〔天宫事义注·序偈〕；gandhaṃ ghāyati（嗅气味）；paññāyati，paññāyanti，paññāyatu，paññāyantu。", "confidence": 65}
{"id": "22-3892-2-14", "zh": "在被动语态中加 kya：dhammo ñāyati（法被了知），dhammā ñāyanti，viññāyati，viññāyanti。", "confidence": 80}
{"id": "22-3893-2-11", "zh": "表示使役作用时加 ṇāpi：ñāpeti，ñāpenti，ñāpayati，ñāpayanti。", "confidence": 80}
{"id": "22-3894-2-29", "zh": "被动语态：ñāpīyati，ñāpīyanti。ṭhāti，ṭhānti：“盛开的莲花挺立着，像编好的花鬘一样挺立，看起来就像旗幡的顶端”（opupphā padmā ṭhānti, mālāva ganthitā ṭhānti, dhajaggāneva dissare）〔本生 2.22.1989〕。", "confidence": 65}
{"id": "22-3895-2-19", "zh": "605. 带 ñ 标记者与 ī 增音之后的 la 变为 e（ñcīlasse）〔ka.510；rū.487；nī.1023〕。", "confidence": 60}
{"id": "22-3896-2-14", "zh": "带 ñ 附加标记的词根、ī 增音，以及在主动语态中所加的 la 词缀，有时变为 e。这里是 la 变为 e。", "confidence": 65}
{"id": "22-3897-2-5", "zh": "adhiṭṭheti，adhiṭṭhenti。", "confidence": 90}
{"id": "22-3898-2-20", "zh": "606. ṭhā、pā 变为 tiṭṭha、piva（ṭhāpānaṃ tiṭṭhapivā）〔ka.468-9；rū.492-4；nī.949〕。", "confidence": 85}
{"id": "22-3899-2-14", "zh": "在 nta、māna 以及 tyādi 词尾之前，ṭhā、pā 变为 tiṭṭha、piva。", "confidence": 85}
{"id": "22-3900-2-5", "zh": "tiṭṭhati，tiṭṭhanti。", "confidence": 90}
{"id": "22-3901-2-23", "zh": "607. 在 pa 等之后，ṭhā 有时可变为 ṭhaha（pādito ṭhāssa vā ṭhaho kvaci）〔ka.517；rū.488；nī.1105〕。", "confidence": 80}
{"id": "22-3902-2-15", "zh": "pa 等前缀称为 pādi；在 pādi 之后的 ṭhā，有时可选地变为 ṭhaha。", "confidence": 80}
{"id": "22-3903-2-17", "zh": "saṇṭhahati，saṇṭhahanti，saṇṭhāti，saṇṭhānti，upaṭṭhahati，upaṭṭhahanti，upaṭṭhāti，upaṭṭhānti。", "confidence": 90}
{"id": "22-3904-2-3", "zh": "被动语态——", "confidence": 85}
{"id": "22-3905-2-27", "zh": "608. 除 ñā 等之外，在 kya 之前变为 i（aññādissi kye）〔ka.502；rū.493；nī.1015；多个版本作‘aññādissāsīkye’〕。", "confidence": 70}
{"id": "22-3906-2-9", "zh": "除 ñā 等之外，其他以 ā 结尾、表示动作的词根，在后面接 kya 时变为 i。", "confidence": 75}
{"id": "22-3907-2-9", "zh": "adhiṭṭhīyati，adhiṭṭhīyanti，upaṭṭhīyati，upaṭṭhīyanti。", "confidence": 90}
{"id": "22-3908-2-4", "zh": "为什么说“除 ñā 等之外”？", "confidence": 85}
{"id": "22-3908-5-16", "zh": "因为有 ñāyati，ñāyanti，ākkhāyati，ākkhāyanti，ākhyāyati，ākhyāyanti 这些形式。", "confidence": 80}
{"id": "22-3909-2-9", "zh": "加 ṇāpi 时：patiṭṭhāpeti，patiṭṭhāpenti，patiṭṭhāpayati，patiṭṭhāpayanti。", "confidence": 85}
{"id": "22-3910-2-23", "zh": "在不定过去时（ajjattanī）中可选地加 s 增音：aṭṭhāsi，patiṭṭhāsi，adhiṭṭhahi，adhiṭṭhāsi，adhiṭṭhesi，saṇṭhahi，saṇṭhāsi，upaṭṭhahi，upaṭṭhāsi。", "confidence": 75}
{"id": "22-3911-2-16", "zh": "依“uṃssiṃsvaṃsū”这条规则，uṃ 变为 iṃsu、aṃsu：adhiṭṭhahiṃsu，saṇṭhahiṃsu，upaṭṭhahiṃsu。", "confidence": 80}
{"id": "22-3911-17-32", "zh": "“太阳落山的时候，猛兽出现在路上”（atthamentamhi sūriye, vāḷā panthe upaṭṭhahuṃ）〔本生 2.22.2186〕。", "confidence": 75}
{"id": "22-3911-33-36", "zh": "aṭṭhaṃsu，upaṭṭhahaṃsu。", "confidence": 90}
{"id": "22-3912-2-12", "zh": "用后组词尾时：“站在佛陀面前”（aṭṭhā buddhassa santike）〔经集 431〕。", "confidence": 65}
{"id": "22-3913-2-9", "zh": "被动语态：adhiṭṭhiyi，adhiṭṭhiyiṃsu，upaṭṭhiyi，upaṭṭhiyiṃsu。", "confidence": 85}
{"id": "22-3914-2-10", "zh": "加 ṇāpi 时：patiṭṭhāpesi，patiṭṭhāpayi，saṇṭhāpesi，saṇṭhāpayi。", "confidence": 85}
{"id": "22-3915-2-25", "zh": "依“eontāsuṃ”这条规则，uṃ 变为 suṃ，并删除元音：aṭṭhāsuṃ，upaṭṭhāsuṃ，patiṭṭhāpesuṃ，saṇṭhāpesuṃ，patiṭṭhāpayuṃ，saṇṭhāpayuṃ，patiṭṭhāpayiṃsu，saṇṭhāpayiṃsu。", "confidence": 75}
{"id": "22-3916-2-28", "zh": "在 ssati 等词尾中：ṭhassati，ṭhassanti；变为短音：upaṭṭhissati，upaṭṭhissanti，“我将侍奉夫人”（ahaṃ bhotiṃ upaṭṭhissaṃ）〔本生 2.22.1934〕；saṇṭhahissati，saṇṭhahissanti。", "confidence": 70}
{"id": "22-3917-2-5", "zh": "加 ṇāpi 时：patiṭṭhāpessati，patiṭṭhāpessanti。", "confidence": 85}
{"id": "22-3918-2-6", "zh": "tā：保护。bhayaṃ tāyati（防护怖畏）。", "confidence": 75}
{"id": "22-3919-2-20", "zh": "thā：站立。avatthāti，avatthāyati，vitthāyati，vitthāyanti，“不要惊慌”（mā kho vitthāsi）〔大品 126〕。", "confidence": 65}
{"id": "22-3920-2-22", "zh": "dā：给予。依“ūlasse”这条规则，la 变为 e：deti，denti，desi，detha，demi，dema。", "confidence": 80}
{"id": "22-3921-2-10", "zh": "依“parokkhāyañcā”这条规则中的 ca 字，dā 重叠。", "confidence": 75}
{"id": "22-3921-11-30", "zh": "依“rasso pubbassā”这条规则，前一音节变为短音：dadāti，dadanti，dadāsi，dadātha，dadāmi，dadāma。", "confidence": 80}
{"id": "22-3922-2-22", "zh": "609. 不重叠时，dā 在 mi、ma 之前可变为 daṃ（dāssa daṃ vā mimesvadvitte）〔ka.482；rū.508；nī.972〕。", "confidence": 80}
{"id": "22-3923-2-13", "zh": "不重叠时，dā 在 mi、ma 之前可选地变为 daṃ，鼻音（niggahīta）变为同组的末音。", "confidence": 75}
{"id": "22-3924-2-5", "zh": "dammi，damma。", "confidence": 90}
{"id": "22-3925-2-4", "zh": "为什么说“不重叠时”？", "confidence": 85}
{"id": "22-3925-5-8", "zh": "因为重叠时作 dadāmi，dadāma。", "confidence": 80}
{"id": "22-3926-2-19", "zh": "610. dā 变为 iya（dāssiyaṅa）〔ka.502；rū.493；nī.1014〕。", "confidence": 75}
{"id": "22-3927-2-9", "zh": "在 pa 等前缀之后的 dā，有时变为 iya。", "confidence": 80}
{"id": "22-3928-2-8", "zh": "通过拆分“iyaṅa”这条规则，其他词根也适用。", "confidence": 65}
{"id": "22-3928-9-96", "zh": "jā：衰损。“我们因小失大”（appena bahuṃ jiyyāma）〔本生 1.2.52〕；“就随顺他”（tassevā’nuvidhiyyati）〔本生 1.2.67〕；“维杜罗的心欢喜”（vidhurassa hadayaṃ dhaniyati）〔本生 2.22.1350〕；“他的名声衰减”（nihīyati tassa yaso）〔本生 1.10.60；增支部 4.17〕；“国王啊，你独自衰落了”（eko rājā vihiyyasi）〔本生 2.22.1750〕；“它将被舍断”（so pahīyissati）〔相应部 1.249〕，等等。", "confidence": 55}
{"id": "22-3929-2-33", "zh": "ādiyati，ādiyanti，upādiyati，upādiyanti，samādiyati，samādiyanti，“我受持学处”（sikkhāpadaṃ samādiyāmi）〔小诵 2.1〕，“我受持行仪”（vattaṃ samādiyāmi）〔小品 85〕。", "confidence": 80}
{"id": "22-3930-2-26", "zh": "611. gama、vada、dā 变为 ghamma、vajja、dajja（gama vada dānaṃ ghamma vajja dajjā）〔ka.499-500-1；rū.443-486-507；nī.1013，1005-1006〕。", "confidence": 80}
{"id": "22-3931-2-15", "zh": "在 nta、māna 以及 tyādi 词尾之前，这些词根可选地变为 ghamma、vajja、dajja。", "confidence": 80}
{"id": "22-3932-2-13", "zh": "dajjati，dajjanti，dajjasi，dajjatha，dajjāmi，dajjāma。", "confidence": 90}
{"id": "22-3933-2-12", "zh": "依“ūlasse”这条规则，la 变为 e：dajjeti，dajjenti。", "confidence": 85}
{"id": "22-3934-2-15", "zh": "在被动语态中，依“aññādissi kye”这条规则，在 kya 之前 ā 变为 i：diyati，diyanti。", "confidence": 80}
{"id": "22-3935-2-5", "zh": "变为长音时：dīyati，dīyanti。", "confidence": 85}
{"id": "22-3936-2-9", "zh": "辅音重叠时：diyyati，diyyanti，dajjīyati，dajjīyanti。", "confidence": 75}
{"id": "22-3937-2-9", "zh": "加 ṇāpi 时：dāpeti，dāpenti，dāpayati，dāpayanti。", "confidence": 85}
{"id": "22-3938-2-25", "zh": "前面有 pa 等前缀时变为短音：samādapeti〔中部 2.387；3.276〕，samādapenti，samādapayati，samādapayanti。", "confidence": 80}
{"id": "22-3939-2-10", "zh": "被动语态：dāpīyati，dāpīyanti，samādapīyati，samādapīyanti。", "confidence": 85}
{"id": "22-3940-2-45", "zh": "在 eyya 等词尾中，依大规则，dajja 之后 eyya 等词尾末端的 eyya 可选地删除：dānaṃ dajjā（愿他布施），dadeyya，dajjuṃ，dadeyyuṃ，dajjāsi，dadeyyāsi，dajjātha，dadeyyātha，dajjāmi，dadeyyāmi，dajjāma，dadeyyāma，ahaṃ dajjaṃ，dadeyyaṃ，mayaṃ dajjāmhe，dadeyyāmhe。", "confidence": 70}
{"id": "22-3941-2-43", "zh": "这里有圣典文句：“善人会布施”（dajjā sappuriso dānaṃ）〔本生 2.22.2261〕；“愿他们送我礼物”（upāyanāni me dajjuṃ）〔本生 2.22.24〕；“你因为母亲有什么过错，要把她交给水罗刹？”（mātaraṃ kena dosena, dajjāsi dakarakkhino）〔本生 1.16.227〕。", "confidence": 70}
{"id": "22-3941-44-72", "zh": "“你把这些交给母亲”（tāni ammāya dajjesi）〔本生 2.22.2149〕；“第六个，我宁可交出自己，也绝不交出大药”（chaṭṭhāhaṃ dajjamattānaṃ, neva dajjaṃ mahosadhaṃ）〔本生 1.16.225〕。", "confidence": 65}
{"id": "22-3942-2-16", "zh": "不定过去时：adadi，adāsi，adaduṃ，adaṃsu，adajji，adajjuṃ，tvaṃ adado。", "confidence": 85}
{"id": "22-3942-17-30", "zh": "“帝释啊，如果你要赐给我恩惠”（varañce me ado sakka）〔本生 2.17.142〕。", "confidence": 75}
{"id": "22-3943-2-21", "zh": "用后组词尾时：“他布施了”（so dānaṃ adā）；“这位使尸毗国兴盛的人，把布施给了婆罗门”（brāhmaṇassa adā dānaṃ, sivīnaṃ raṭṭhavaḍḍhano）〔本生 2.22.2117〕。", "confidence": 65}
